#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/62
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "YOU DESEVE SO MUCH BETTER. I MEAN WHY CANT EVERYONE SEE HOW AMAZING YOU ARE?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/70
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "but you know what else?? Why cantt people see how amazing I AM??"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/78
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "i men IMM HOT and CUTE and SEXY and SO SMART. I THINK. <w>Maybe not that lasto ne </w>."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/86
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "But im allthe other things right? RIGHT."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/94
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "soo why does NO ONE LOVE ME? wHY IS THAT??"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/102
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "<w>THEY WONT EVEN COME DIRNK WITH EM.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/110
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I mean ME. WHo is EM? Maybe someone that people actually LIKE. Oohoooo...."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/118
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Oh my god how i just wasted my life?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/126
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Oh nononoonono...."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/134
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "oh my gosh i HAVE. i have... no wonder no one comes here!! Why WOULD THY???"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/142
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Beverly bursts into tears, ugly, heaving sobs wracking her body."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/150
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "<i>Wahhhhahaha!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awwww bevvy nononono ouyou’re gonna be okay"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "you’re always there for meeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "<w>hic</w> thank you so much <w>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa </w> why are you so good."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I KNOWWW YOU ARE SO DONT EVEN ARGUE WIT ME"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/34
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "you just gotta. Just gtta FGIHT for what you want. You know? Show that you CARE. show that you’re gonna be your BEST SELF no matter WHAT. and then you WILL BE."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/42
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "wait oh my god maybe that’s what i need to do for MYSEL."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/50
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "If no one else will lift me up i just gotta lift MYSELF UP"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/58
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "YEAH!! THAT’S IS."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/66
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I GOTTA GET STRONG SO I CAN LIFT MYSELF!!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/74
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "MAYBE I ALREADY AM!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/82
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "YEAHHHHHHHHH!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/93
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Urp! Oh no..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/101
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Nope. Tha wasn't a good noise, ws it?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-1/161/c-0/112
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "aww crap. Fade to black before it gets messy!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-2/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I think I’ll pour myself a drink too!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/toast/0/toastjoin/c-2/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Do you mind if I mix a cocktail?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes actually. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, go right ahead!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "No need to be sorry! I’ll just have a mocktail like you then!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/15 beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-1/15 beverly_beverage/beverly_friendship_return/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Cheers!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cheers!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "You know, I really appreciate your honesty with me."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I feel like some people would have taken a cocktail just to be polite, but you know what you want and you stick with it! That’s admirable!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Do you mind if I ask why though?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t enjoy being drunk or being around drunks."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just don’t see the point or the fun in getting drunk until I’m sick."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just don’t like the taste."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have a complicated history with alcohol."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Ah, I getcha. It can be pretty overwhelming. And disorienting. Not to mention embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "People get loud and say things they wouldn’t say otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Hey! Getting sick at a party can be a great bonding experience."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "The person that holds your hair out of the toilet and pats your back is someone you can trust!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "As long as the toilet isn’t Jean Loo. UGH. The less said about him the better."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Mn, I understand. It’s certainly not for everyone."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "But hey, if you ever change your mind I can recommend some drinks where you can barely taste the alcohol."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-3/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Say no more, I read you loud and clear."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-3/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Knowing that though, I’m surprised you came back to see me."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-3/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I must make a damn good mocktail! That actually makes me kinda proud."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-3/31
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Oh, shucks. You got me blushing now."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-3/39
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Well, have as many as you want. I’ll be here all night. <3"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m just glad you came back."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I was worried that once you helped me, you’d move on and I’d never see you again."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/16
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Having everyone over was so fun, but once they all left I was so lonely."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/24
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "And I’m stressing over if any of them will actually come back or not."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/32
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I feel like I’ve always chased people away just by being myself."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/40
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "If I want The Tipsy Tumbler to survive I can’t let that happen anymore."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/48
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "So... thanks for being a returning customer."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-0/23/c-0/31/g-0/56
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Let’s have a good time! Responsibly!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_choice/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Great, thanks! We gotta get rid of this booze somehow right?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Several drinks later..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/8
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Whyyyy doesn’t anyeone <w>LOVE ME?</w>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh boy... Maybe we should stop."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Comfort her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "NO, no I dont wanna stop!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "if I STOP then you LEAV. AND I’LL BE all alone again. <w>FOREVER.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Let her talk</i>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Becasue <w>THA \"S we hAT EVERYBODY Does </w>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/8
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "<w>SLIKE I think the PROBEL MIS N\" T eth BAr</w>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/16
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "...'sme."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sme?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "It's always been me..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "We coulad HEVA the be st adevirtISNG EVERY but I'm still the problem."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not a problem..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, you may have a point there."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "<w>Yes I\" AM! I'm LAud I'm OBNOXIUS...</w>"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/16/g-0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Thank you... fer lissening..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-0/23/g-0/24/g-0/16/g-0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Beverly appears to have fallen asleep. You take your leave, tiptoeing away."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I'm sorry. Ahhh I'm horrible."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you need to go lie down. I’ll close the bar for the night. Okay?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Will you stay wth me later? Just until I fall asleep?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t think that’s a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay. Beverly’s asleep. Now’s a good time to leave."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Aw come onnnnn! Pleassssssseeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No Bev. You need to get some rest, and I do too."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Nooo! But then you’ll leaveee!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I don’t want you to gooo! I like you!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! Wow. Um. Well I-"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you, but I don't like this."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Beverly knocks out before you can even respond, snoring loudly."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Zzzz...."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You do your best to make her comfortable before you leave, tiptoeing away."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Where are you going?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Do you hate me?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, of course not!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Thank you... I’m sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’ll go lie down. Can you close up the bar for me, please?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "And... will you stay with me afterwards?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, of course."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_bev_drinks/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-1/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/3
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Hey... you’re alive!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... are you?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I think so, well... not alive. I've never been that..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "But awake..and in one piece... yeah."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Everything is agony, but I’m still here I guess."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "How are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My head is full of pain and regret."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Please</i> keep your voice down."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Totally worth it."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Aw... I’m sorry."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Surely it wasn’t all bad though, right?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "At least I hope it wasn’t, I can’t remember."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "It feels like my brain is trying to claw its way out of my skull."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I mean... I had fun!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-1/50
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Next time will be better! I promise!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-2/7 beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Gotcha, sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Aww! <i>Urp</i> You mean it?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m sure you’ll mean it more when the hangover goes away haha..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "That may be the nicest thing anyone has ever said to me!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m so happy you didn’t leave. I love... having you around."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Don’t move, I’ll make us a couple hangover cures."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/player_drunk_awaken/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m just gonna make it slowly... moving too much makes the lights hurt."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Good morning!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not morning..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Morning Bev! You seem chipper today."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I just feel good! After our mocktail party I went out and put up more flyers! Then I talked to Phoenicia for advice on buying Placebook ads."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "All in all, a very productive night. I just feel like I’m on the edge of good things now!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "And I have you to thank! You really gave me the push that I needed."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’ve learned so many things that I know I’m gonna put to use everyday!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m really gonna put in the work to make THIS work!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I can’t stop just because I invented one good drink! The Tipsy Tumbler is gonna succeed, and I want you to see it when it does!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Well, I’m going to roll up my sleeves and get this place looking more presentable. So no drinks today."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/59/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "But... please come back some time. I’d love to see my favorite drinking buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/59/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got it, buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/59/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aren't we more than buddies?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/59/c-3/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Uh yeah, we totally are!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/59/c-3/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Sorry I'm just so not used to saying this but...."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/mocktail_return/0/g-0/59/c-3/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Ahhh I love you!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Oh! You... you actually came back??"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Ugh, God I’m so embarrassed. You really saw me at my worst."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "But you stayed... which means so much to me."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I didn’t think you’d want to see me after the mess I was in last time. I'm so sorry you had to see that..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I wanted to talk about that."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s no problem!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Look, I’m fine! There’s no problem! I just drink for fun!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "It’s not like I’m secretly trying to cope with my crippling fears and anxieties or anything."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I mean. I don’t know! I’m stressed!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/39
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "And when I’m sober all I do is think about the things I’m stressed about more!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/47
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I just. Um. Look, can we talk about this later?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure thing."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-2/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I want to get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m so relieved to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Seriously, I’m glad you’re cool with it. I mean, everyone who drinks has at least one embarrassing experience, right? So it’s really no big deal, right?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "At least this one didn’t end with me waking up with my face on the bathroom floor beside Jean Loo."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-3/37
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "The last thing you wanna hear when you’re hung over is him <i>rapping</i> in your ear."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-3/45
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "\"Bev's drunk again, slumped in a pile, / Ain't got friends and ain't got style / Ran out of wine, all that's left are the lines / Pressed into her face from the bathroom tile!\""
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-0/c-3/53
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I hate him. I hate him so much."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I just wish I had been a better host for you. I’m sorry."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We’ll have more fun next time!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All the more reason to be more careful with your drinking?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/c-4/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Hey yeah!! Next time we’ll throw a REAL rager! One that doesn’t end with one of us in the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/c-4/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Hell yeah, I’m excited for it!!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/c-5/7
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Hmm... I don’t quite follow..."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/c-5/15
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Of course I’m careful! I didn’t spill anything, or drop any glasses, or get sick outside the toilet!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/drinknow/c-5/23
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "I’m surprisingly coordinated when I’m wasted. Years of practice pays off!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "So... why did you come back?"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just wanted to make sure you were okay."
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/Bev_Drunk_Return/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're hot."
msgstr ""

