#: beverly_beverage/beverly_hate_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Here let me try it. I’m sorry! POOF! <i>GASP</i> Oh my gosh! My broken dreams are fixed!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/beverly_hate_return/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "And that feeling that I’m a huge failure that led me to an endless downward spiral? All gone! WOW!"
msgstr ""

#: beverly_beverage/beverly_hate_return/0/c-1/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sigh... Look, I’ll go. I am sorry. Good luck Beverly..."
